      "description": "Follie™ — The All-in-One Anesthesia Reference for Students and Clinicians\n\n620 procedures. 1,373 comorbidities. 276 drugs. Built by a clinician who knows what you need at the bedside.\n\nBUILT FOR IPHONE DUO\nOptimized for every posture: the cover screen closed, a book half open, two pages side by side flat, each with its own tabs.\n\nDICTATE\nA mic on search and every notes field. Speech becomes text on the phone; audio never leaves it.\n\nANESTHETIC PLAN GENERATOR (Patent Pending)\nEnter patient data across 8 pages; Follie generates a complete anesthetic plan. 620 procedures, 24 specialties. On-device, instant.\n\nFOLLIE ACADEMY\nOut of beta. 1,316 board-style questions with rationales and citations, Recitations (spaced-repetition cards), timed exams in the real format for CAA certification, CAA recertification, and the ABA BASIC, and exam-date pacing. Free for SAAs and SRNAs through graduation and six months after, and for residents in their first year; a $4.99 per month add-on for practitioners.\n\nFOLLIE NETWORK (separate subscription)\nAsk in your own words. Follie Network answers from several library pages at once and runs the app's calculators; tap a citation to open its page. Anything outside the library is labelled. Needs internet.\n\nCOMORBIDITIES\n1,373 conditions with anesthetic implications and preop/intraop/postop guidance.\n\nEMERGENCY PROTOCOLS\nWeight-based dosing for ACLS, PALS, MH, anaphylaxis, and LAST. Crisis checklists. Difficult airway algorithm.\n\nDRUG REFERENCE LIBRARY\n276 agents with dosing, onset/duration, contraindications, side effects, and pearls. Drip dilutions in the search bar.\n\nCLINICAL CALCULATORS\n34 calculators — MAC, ETT size and depth, IBW/ABW/BSA, blood loss, ABG, opioid conversion, RCRI, Apfel, Parkland, CrCl, and more.\n\n170+ REFERENCE SHEETS\nSubspecialty anesthesia, pharmacology, monitoring, ICU, bedside procedures, and physiology. 1,127 abbreviations. 43 regional blocks.\n\nMULTILINGUAL MEDICAL PHRASES\nPatient phrases in 10 languages, written and spoken. An aid, not a substitute for a qualified interpreter.\n\nCASEBOOK\nPlans, Case Log, Notebook, and anesthesia team cards. Track cases by procedure, technique, rotation, and role; export to CSV. Quick Handoff for PACU. Camera OCR.\n\nHOME, YOUR WAY\nChoose your start tab, pin favorites, hide what you do not use. App-icon shortcuts. An inbox with the Gazette; Cordle, PEEPle, and Label Breaker in Downtime.\n\nALSO\nApple/Google sign-in and sync, same account in the browser. PDF export. Pre-op checklist. Red screen mode. ASRA timing. NPO guidelines. ASA guide. Student accounts for anesthesia programs: follie@heyattuned.com.\n\nCLINICAL INTEGRITY\n150+ cited references from Miller's, Stoelting's, Barash, ASA, ASRA, AHA, AABB, and more.\n\nSUBSCRIPTION\nFree to download. Full access is a subscription or a one-time purchase:\n• Monthly — $7.99 per month\n• Annual — $49.99 per year\n• Lifetime — $99.99, one payment, no renewal\nNew subscribers get a 7-day free trial.\nTwo add-ons are separate and NOT included in full access or Lifetime:\n• Follie Network — $2.99 per month; free answers included, no trial.\n• Follie Academy — $4.99 per month for practitioners; free for SAAs and SRNAs, and for residents in their first year.\nSubscriptions renew automatically unless canceled at least 24 hours before the period ends.\n\nALREADY BOUGHT FOLLIE? IT STAYS YOURS.\nYour access is permanent.\n\n© 2026 Attuned Labs LLC. All rights reserved.\n\nLicensing Agreement (Apple): https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nTerms: https://heyfollie.com/terms\nPrivacy: https://heyfollie.com/privacy\n\nDisclaimers:\n\n\t1.\tFollie is an educational reference tool, not a substitute for professional medical judgment. Always consult a qualified provider before making clinical decisions.\n\t2.\tSome features may be offered as separate subscriptions in future updates.\n\t3.\tFollie Network uses AI to compose answers